{"I18n fallback mechanism is incomplete - requires manual calls to I18n.fallbacks.ensure_loaded! after setting the locale, which is missing in critical contexts like background jobs, rake tasks, and test setup, leading to potential translation errors": 0.740685224533081, "The I18n.fallbacks.ensure_loaded! call needs to be added to app/jobs/base.rb after I18n.locale is set to prevent bugs in background job processing": 0.5641859769821167, "The I18n initializer should be modified to automatically call ensure_loaded! whenever the locale is changed by patching the I18n.locale= setter method": 0.5030702948570251}